<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 30.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 percent protein to Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire May 112.00 Jun 113.00/114.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat to East Anglia May 95.50 Jun 97.00 Jul 99.50 asa 94.00</p>
<p>Tilbury May 95.50</p>
<p>Southampton May 95.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire May 93.00/93.25</p>
<p>Cheshire/Shorpshire May 95.50</p>
<p>Liverpool May 97.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk May 94.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk May 92.00 July/Aug 90.00</p>
<p>South Lincolnshire May 92.00</p>
<p>Yorkshire May 94.00</p>
<p>Avon range May 95.00 Jul/Aug 90.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire May 93.00 Jun 94.00</p>
